Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.83,Say,,0,0,0,,Everybody plants a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.45,Say,,0,0,0,,Nobody finds out what happened to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:06.30,Say,,0,0,0,,A birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:07.38,Say,,0,0,0,,A school drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.82,Say,,0,0,0,,A company afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:11.84,Say,,0,0,0,,They plant it, they take the photo, they post it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.31,Say,,0,0,0,,and that is where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:15.27,Say,,0,0,0,,The planting is an event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.15,Say,,0,0,0,,The keeping alive is a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.25,Say,,0,0,0,,So how much of it lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.76,Say,,0,0,0,,India's national auditor went and looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:24.67,Say,,0,0,0,,Of a two point eight million hectare target,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:26.53,Say,,0,0,0,,about five percent was achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.80,Say,,0,0,0,,At seventy percent of the sites,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.96,Say,,0,0,0,,no improvement in tree cover at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:33.89,Say,,0,0,0,,One site reported two thousand plantings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:35.02,Say,,0,0,0,,Thirty were found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:36.15,Say,,0,0,0,,None had survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:39.03,Say,,0,0,0,,And here is the part that explains the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:42.59,Say,,0,0,0,,Four out of five plantation records did not say what was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:45.17,Say,,0,0,0,,planted, where it stood, or whether it lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:47.89,Say,,0,0,0,,Nobody was ever asked to keep one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:49.74,Say,,0,0,0,,Planting is not the solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:51.01,Say,,0,0,0,,Keeping it alive is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.63,Say,,0,0,0,,And we already pay people to do boring things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:57.91,Say,,0,0,0,,Pay a credit card bill on time, and you earn points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:01:00.13,Say,,0,0,0,,Water the tree you planted last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:01.55,Say,,0,0,0,,and nothing happens at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.48,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted pays you for keeping it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.26,Say,,0,0,0,,The tulsi on the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.28,Say,,0,0,0,,The money plant in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:10.12,Say,,0,0,0,,The lemon by the kitchen window.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:12.18,Say,,0,0,0,,The sapling from last month's drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:13.56,Say,,0,0,0,,Same app, same schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.12,Say,,0,0,0,,You do not have to know anything about the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:18.60,Say,,0,0,0,,Every plant carries its own coordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:21.23,Say,,0,0,0,,and the schedule moves with the weather over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:23.64,Say,,0,0,0,,Rain pushes the next watering out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:24.70,Say,,0,0,0,,Heat pulls it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:27.79,Say,,0,0,0,,And you are not expected to know any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:30.71,Say,,0,0,0,,When to feed it, what to spray, how often to water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:32.15,Say,,0,0,0,,It tells you, on the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:34.93,Say,,0,0,0,,Water, on this species own interval,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:37.03,Say,,0,0,0,,moved by the rain and the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:40.72,Say,,0,0,0,,Feeding, with what this plant wants, and less than you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:44.18,Say,,0,0,0,,because what the roots do not take ends up in the groundwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:47.18,Say,,0,0,0,,Pests, with what goes wrong with this species,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:49.14,Say,,0,0,0,,and the mildest thing that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.63,Say,,0,0,0,,And a weekly look while it establishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.67,0:01:53.95,Say,,0,0,0,,which is when losing it is least visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.69,0:01:56.93,Say,,0,0,0,,Every plant also carries a health score.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:59.70,Say,,0,0,0,,Thriving, steady, watch it, at risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:02.32,Say,,0,0,0,,and one sentence saying what moved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:05.61,Say,,0,0,0,,It does not read the leaves and call the plant sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:07.47,Say,,0,0,0,,A yellow leaf has a dozen causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:11.03,Say,,0,0,0,,The camera then tells you what would make the shot pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:11.87,Say,,0,0,0,,Out loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:15.37,Say,,0,0,0,,because whoever is doing this is holding a watering can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:23.22,Say,,0,0,0,,It reads the frame twice a second, on the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.37,Say,,0,0,0,,uploading nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.69,0:02:27.14,Say,,0,0,0,,Tilt down so the soil is in frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:29.04,Say,,0,0,0,,Then the ring turns green.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:33.03,Say,,0,0,0,,Then it is checked, and every check says the number it measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:34.64,Say,,0,0,0,,It came off the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:35.62,Say,,0,0,0,,The time is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:38.68,Say,,0,0,0,,The location matches where this plant was registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:42.96,Say,,0,0,0,,And soil five percent darker than that plant's own dry baseline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:44.34,Say,,0,0,0,,Measured, not guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:46.58,Say,,0,0,0,,This is the one that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:49.86,Say,,0,0,0,,If any plant earned points, the points would be worth nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:53.36,Say,,0,0,0,,So OpenCV matches keypoints against the plant's first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:56.74,Say,,0,0,0,,photograph, and asks whether they agree on one viewpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:59.73,Say,,0,0,0,,The same plant returns four hundred and eighty five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:03.79,Say,,0,0,0,,A different plant of the same species, in a similar pot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:04.64,Say,,0,0,0,,returns four.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:08.84,Say,,0,0,0,,Registering a plant checks the photograph before it accepts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:11.32,Say,,0,0,0,,Point it at a notebook and it says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.75,Say,,0,0,0,,An object scores nought point two percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.77,Say,,0,0,0,,The weakest real plant scored nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.81,0:03:21.62,Say,,0,0,0,,Point it at a plant and it works out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:24.34,Say,,0,0,0,,Seventy-eight species, searched by local name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.01,Say,,0,0,0,,A plant cannot wait for you to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:29.06,Say,,0,0,0,,So Rooted does not wait to be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:33.32,Say,,0,0,0,,When a task comes due, the same message goes out on WhatsApp,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:34.28,Say,,0,0,0,,email and text.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:37.67,Say,,0,0,0,,A name, a plant and a date go to the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:39.87,Say,,0,0,0,,No photographs, no coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:43.27,Say,,0,0,0,,Organisations spend heavily on planting drives,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:45.46,Say,,0,0,0,,and get back a photograph from day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:48.59,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted produces the record of what survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:51.31,Say,,0,0,0,,every point traceable to one verified task.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:53.38,Say,,0,0,0,,That record funds the rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.82,Say,,0,0,0,,The offers are stand-ins,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:58.33,Say,,0,0,0,,because naming a real company would put words in their mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:01.45,Say,,0,0,0,,And somebody is already paying for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:05.48,Say,,0,0,0,,Indian companies put forty thousand crore rupees into social
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:07.08,Say,,0,0,0,,spending in a single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:10.43,Say,,0,0,0,,Three thousand four hundred crore of that went into
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:13.31,Say,,0,0,0,,environmental work, up forty percent in one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:14.84,Say,,0,0,0,,And above ten crore,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:18.54,Say,,0,0,0,,the law already asks them for an independent assessment of what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:19.66,Say,,0,0,0,,the money achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:21.21,Say,,0,0,0,,The money is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:23.66,Say,,0,0,0,,The proof is the part nobody can produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:26.34,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted makes it, one verified task at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.19,Say,,0,0,0,,by the person who did the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:30.71,Say,,0,0,0,,We reward people for spending money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:34.05,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted rewards them for keeping something alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:35.55,Say,,0,0,0,,Plant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.59,0:04:36.17,Say,,0,0,0,,Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.41,Say,,0,0,0,,Get paid for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.57,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted is already everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:43.42,Say,,0,0,0,,It opens on any phone and sits on the home screen like an app.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:45.23,Say,,0,0,0,,No store, nothing to install.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.33,Say,,0,0,0,,Scan the left one to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:50.09,Say,,0,0,0,,Scan the right one to read every line of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.76,0:04:53.46,Say,,0,0,0,,Nothing in here reports a number it did not measure.
